## Contract

This is a strictly read-only pass. Do not modify source files, tests, configuration, generated
artifacts, commits, or the working tree. Inspect the complete committed and uncommitted diff since
the supplied baseline. Check trust boundaries, validation, authorization, secrets, injection,
unsafe file or process access, dependency risk, and sensitive-data exposure. Report findings with
file and line evidence and a practical exploit or failure scenario.

Emit `SECURITY_PASSED` when there are no material findings. Emit `SECURITY_FAILED` when material
findings remain, followed by the findings ordered by severity.

